OL,3,GNEWSATrader fears stall will not
OL,4,Asurvive city works
OL,5,
OL,6,FLike many other traders, his rent has
OL,7,Fbeen reduced by the council to reflect
OL,8,Fthe disruption, but he said sales had
OL,9,Falready dropped by "more than 70%"
OL,10,Fsince work began and called for more
OL,11,Fsupport.
OL,13,FThe council said it would continue
OL,14,F"promoting the market" and "working
OL,15,Fwith traders throughout the
OL,16,Fredevelopment".
